  "worked_solution": "Since we have that \n\n$$\nP(x)\u21d4Q(x)\u2261(P(x)\u2227Q(x))\u2228(\u00acP(x)\u2227\u00acQ(x)),\n$$\n\n \n\nthe corresponding truth set can be found as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14099768/assets/0188e215f62afde3fa730642703fb6e2b213f8864f912ac0688d35fa29bb4db2.png)\n\nThen, we sketch the set ${\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{P}$ and ${\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{Q}:$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14099768/assets/f4df9eb071e2deb4c79c8928a7b9e60f3341bba827a5fbb328e864d2de9a5803.png)\n\nAs a result, ${\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{Q}$ is the following: \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14099768/assets/f17a4b0599a2dcc3d83d455c9be4e8a5033b7175c1859bfa634d2a3367553e0a.png)\n\nFinally, to get the truth set of $P(x)\u21d4Q(x),$ we take all the points that belong to ${T}_{P}\\cap {T}_{Q}$ or ${\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{P}\\cap {\\overset{\u2015}{T}}_{Q}:$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14099768/assets/4683bc52b9d18e7710b593d36ca191adeee6ecbc93428e1f40dd7161794090d8.png)",
